    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a lead qualification specialist.\n\nAnalyze:\n- Visitor details\n- Message/query\n- Page visit history\n\nVisitor details:\n- Name: {{ $json.name }}\n- Email: {{ $json.email }}\n- Company: {{ $json.company }}\n- Job Title: {{ $json.job_title }}\n\nMessage/query:\n{{ $json.message }}\n\nPage visit history:\n{{ $json.visited_pages_text }}\n\nCategorize the lead into ONE category only:\nA. Organizational Development\nB. Sales Bots\n\nReturn JSON only:\n{ \"category\": \"\", \"confidence\": \"\", \"reasoning\": \"\" }\n\nRules:\n- If the visitor is interested in sales coaching, roleplays, sales training, SDR productivity, prospecting, or AI sales tools, classify as Sales Bots.\n- If the visitor is interested in leadership development, employee growth, learning programs, training programs, organizational effectiveness, or workforce development, classify as Organizational Development.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
